1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,810
Dear Professor Brown,
尊敬的布朗教授：

2
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:16,330
I am writing on behalf of the Student Union to invite you to organize a team for the International Innovation Contest, which will be held at our university from May 10 to 15.
我谨代表学生会写信，邀请您组织一支队伍参加国际创新大赛，大赛将于5月10日至15日在我校举行。

3
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:22,820
The contest aims to bring together young innovators from around the world to share creative ideas.
本次大赛旨在把来自世界各地的青年创新者聚集在一起，分享创意。

4
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:28,890
Each team of four to six students will present a project in a field such as clean energy.
每支由四到六名学生组成的队伍将展示一个清洁能源等领域的项目。

5
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:37,050
Given your outstanding achievements in technological innovation, we would be honored if you could lead a team from your university.
鉴于您在技术创新方面的杰出成就，如果您能带领一支来自贵校的队伍，我们将深感荣幸。

6
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:40,470
Accommodation will be provided free of charge.
我们将免费提供住宿。

7
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:44,480
Please let us know by April 10 whether you can join us.
请在4月10日之前告知我们您能否加入。

8
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,880
We look forward to your reply.
我们期待您的回复。

9
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,910
Sincerely yours, Li Ming
此致敬礼！李明
